            "id": "24302806-33f2-56cc-b973-1b8e4a8d9510"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", the weapon deals an additional 1d8 damage of the selected type instead of 1 additional damage per die; if the weapon already had the resonant weapon trait, it deals 1d8 damage plus 1 damage per die instead. On a critical hit, the weapon deals 1d8 persistent damage of the same type."
